<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="Description">Description</span></h2>
<p>Returns N nearest object of a specific type, with a specifc tag
</p><p>Cite DavidSims: "GetNearestObjectByTag returns an array of all creatures in the current area with the given tag, sorted by distance to the specificied object."
</p>
